items.body:
from IRL discussion at the sprint:

- would it make sense for the variable importance estimators to be usable as scikit-learn transformers in a pipeline, similar to scikit-learn [SelectFromModel](https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.feature_selection.SelectFromModel.html) ?
- if scikit-learn compatibility is important, estimators should not do anything else than store the arguments in `__init__`. for example CFI sets some private attributes and does some checks. also validation of user-provided parameters should not use assert (which are not executed when running the interpreter in optimized mode) but raise exceptions like valueerror, typeerror, etc
